ES-DE Frontend (Android find rules)
-----------------------------------
The `knownActivities` section of the same file is derived from
`resources/systems/android/es_find_rules.xml` of ES-DE (https://gitlab.com/es-de/emulationstation-de).
Launch recipes for aPS3e and aX360e in `players.json` follow the same project's
`resources/systems/android/es_systems.xml`.

